Z||000003||fropuff||06-23-2000||09:25 PM||||Lenny, I know it's none of my business to read a post to Darklord and DXR_DAD, but I accidentally clicked on it and thought I'd enlighten you.  If you want to do the back up light modification, it will be pretty hard to find the lights.  I went to five different places and still can't find these lights.  A guy at an auto parts store looked up the part name and couldn't even special order them.  You could, like DXR_DAD said, find many of them at a junk yard from other cars that would fit, but I just don't have the time to do this, so I'll just have to keep trying.  <BR>||||reg||4
